  "text": "Paxos and Raft use leader-based consensus for approval binding, with Paxos resolving conflicts via multi-phase proposals [[1]]. Uncertain writes in blockchain use Merkle trees for reconciliation [[2]]. Generation charges (e.g., model training) differ from embedding charges (e.g., data storage) in cost attribution [[3]]. Silent retries are prohibited per academic consensus protocols [[4]]. Reconciliation requires explicit validator confirmation before dispatch [[5]].",
